Standard approach: dp[mask] where mask represents set of used elements. For each mask with even popcount, we find the first unused element i, then pair it with each other unused element j, compute new mask, and dp[newMask] = max(dp[newMask], dp[mask] + (popcount(mask)/2 + 1) * gcd(nums[i], nums[j])).

